    <string name="about_about_bahgo">ABOUT BAHGO</string>
    <string name="about_bahgo_is_a_flood">BahGo is a flood-monitoring app for the streets of Palar Village, Taguig City. Water-level and rain sensors installed on Sealion, Samaritan, Swingfire and Striker Streets send live readings to the app, so residents can see how deep the water is, how fast it is rising, and whether it is safe to walk or drive through, before they go.\n\nBahGo also forecasts the water level and flood risk for the next 30 minutes using machine learning, warns you with a notification when a street reaches Warning or Critical, and shows the week\'s rain outlook. It was built as a thesis project to help the community prepare for and stay safe during floods.</string>
